    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84945" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολῠ-κλήϊς</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑδος</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλείς</span> IV) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with
				many benches</i> of rowers, in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> always in dat., as epith. of ships, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηῒ πολυκλήϊδι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.88
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				20.382
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηυσὶ πολυκλήϊσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.74
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				175
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆα πολυκλήϊδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					817
				</span></i>
			.</div>
